Your deliverable: the platform-build portfolio piece — the artifact you walk an interviewer through.
- **Repo scaffold** with the full layout and a README that explains the whole system in one page.
- **Terraform for the VPC**, **scripted cluster bootstrap**, **CI pipeline**, **GitOps deploy** — each piece committed as code.
- **Two ADRs**: the GitOps choice and one infrastructure choice, each with context, alternatives, and consequences.
- **One runbook**: the CrashLooping triage procedure, written for a teammate at 3am.
- **The 10-minute walkthrough**: repo → cluster → pipeline → deploy, ending with 'the scaffold is the platform's first impression.'
Reference shelf (module sources): **Terraform Documentation** (https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/docs). **GitHub Actions Documentation** (https://docs.github.com/en/actions). **Kubernetes Documentation** (https://kubernetes.io/docs/).

