Your deliverable: a DevOps interview dossier.
- **Pipeline design doc** from a timed round, with the rollback story and the strategy matrix.
- **Troubleshooting debrief**: the seeded failure, your hypothesis chain, where narration broke down, the fix.
- **Story bank**: five STAR ops stories (on-call, incident, disagreement, failure, learning) — each with a measurable result.
- **Your interviewer questions**, with notes on what good vs worrying answers sound like.
- **Compensation worksheet**: your market range from data, the whole-package checklist, and the 'negotiate once, informed and in good faith' plan.
- **The taper plan**: no new topics in the final two weeks — redrill, mock, rest.
Reference shelf (module sources): **GitHub Actions Documentation** (https://docs.github.com/en/actions). **Indeed Career Guide: Interviewing** (https://www.indeed.com/career-advice) — STAR format and preparation checklists.

