Your deliverable: a cloud interview dossier.
- **Three architecture one-pagers**: three-tier web, event-driven serverless, data pipeline — each costed with assumptions.
- **Deep-dive sheets**: the internals of a load balancer, a managed queue, and a managed database — mechanism-level, one page each.
- **The cost-cutting drill**: your architecture with 30% removed, and what each cut costs in reliability.
- **Score sheets** against the Well-Architected pillars, with the weakest pillar's study plan.
- **Reflection**: which 'Design X' pattern still isn't automatic, and the reps that will make it so.
Reference shelf (module sources): **AWS Well-Architected Framework** (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/framework/welcome.html). **Azure Architecture Center** (https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/).

