Your deliverable: the full security design review — the artifact security interviews revolve around.
- **The threat model**: STRIDE-lite table per data flow, risk-ranked, mitigations with owners.
- **The architecture review**: trust boundaries, data flows, failure modes, scaling story — findings risk-ranked with concrete fixes.
- **The auth design**: for a new service, from the threat model — MFA, token lifetimes, session handling, rate limits, secrets.
- **The review document**: consultant-style, criticals first, business impact in business terms.
- **The 5-minute presentation**: top 3 findings, defended against pushback.
Reference shelf (module sources): **OWASP** (https://owasp.org/) — Top 10 and project pages. **HashiCorp Vault Documentation** (https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/docs) — secrets engines and dynamic credentials.

