Your deliverable: a security interview dossier.
- **One threat-model writeup**, **one code-review finding with fix**, **one detection with tuning rationale** — sanitized, method-forward.
- **The breach story**, written then rehearsed aloud in 5 minutes — blameless, evidence-driven.
- **Mock score sheets** for all three technical rounds plus behavioral, with the weakest axis's redrill plan.
- **The portfolio index**: what each piece demonstrates, and the story you'd tell walking through it.
- **The taper note**: no new topics in the final two weeks — redrill, mock, rest.
Reference shelf (module sources): **OWASP** (https://owasp.org/). **MITRE ATT&CK** (https://attack.mitre.org/).

