Your deliverable: the deep-dive dossier for your target role.
- **The JD exam**: each bullet mapped to predicted questions, with your story and deep-dive per bullet.
- **One-level-deeper sheets**: mechanism, tradeoff, and story for the top 8 skills — teach-back ready.
- **The tradeoff bank**: the cost side of every technique you claim, in your own words.
- **The gap log**: teach-back stumbles converted to study cards, worked until the explanation is clean.
- **One full deep-dive mock**: 45 minutes on your domain, follow-ups until you hit the boundary — then the honest recovery, practiced.
